  bgs subtract framenumber  frame data  lowthresholdmask  highthresholdmask   
  lowthresholdmask clear    
  bgs update framenumber  frame data  lowthresholdmask   
 
  img foreground   cv  cvarrtomat highthresholdmask ptr     
